<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drinker, tippler, toper,</i> usu. in fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότις</span></b>  (masc. only metaph.,
				v. infr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότις γυνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.Com.
					71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ααῒς ἀργὸς καὶ πότις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicr.
					3
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότης λύχνος</span> a
				<i>tippling</i> lamp, i.e. that consumes much oil, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				57
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίλβη πότις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					190
				</span></i>
			: Com.
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτίσταται γυναῖκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					735
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				12.26
			</span></i>.</div>
